OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Crown Prosecution Service (CPS)
OL,7,Fsecured a confiscation order earlier
OL,8,Fthat is equal to the value of the 30
OL,9,FBitcoin recovered from Chowles, which
OL,10,Fhas ballooned from #36,000 to more than
OL,11,F#1.8m.
